          "filename": "'Youth Vision' sculpture, ECOS Centre, Ballymena - geograph.org.uk - 532813.jpg",
          "caption": "'Youth Vision' sculpture, ECOS Centre, Ballymena 'Youth Vision' was a cross-community youth project involving young people aged between 12 and 16 years, from Waveney and Ballykeel Youth Clubs. They designed a metal tree with intertwining branches which doubles as a signpost. The sign points to both Waveney and Ballykeel estates as well as the Woodland Trusts Keel Wood, the Peoples Park and the Ecos Centre.",
